[2.670159, "o", "  Get started:\r\n    pd setup                  [notify] Install daemon, MCP, FleetBar, hooks, Guard\r\n    pd hooks install          [notify] Wire coordination into claude/codex/gemini/agy (per-project, daemon-gated)\r\n    pd begin \"purpose\" --lifecycle durable  [notify] I'll set up your agent + session\r\n    pd done \"summary\"        [notify] Finish up — I'll clean everything\r\n    pd whoami                [silent] See your current context\r\n    pd attention             [notify] What other agents queued for you (run first thing!)\r\n  \r\n  Ports:\r\n    pd claim <id>            [notify] I'll assign a port  (c)\r\n    pd release <id>          [notify] Free it up  (r)  (--expired is destructive)\r\n    pd find [pattern]        [silent] What's running  (f, l, ps)\r\n  \r\n  Sessions & notes:\r\n    pd session start \"why\"   [notify] Manual session start\r\n    pd session takeover <id> [notify] Continue stale work, preserve notes\r\n    pd takeover <id>         [notify] Alias for session takeover\r\n    pd session abandon        [destructive] End session as abandoned, release claims\r\n"]
